add xcode      "Build and tool caches" safe    "Xcode DerivedData"                      "remove DerivedData (Xcode rebuilds it)"
add playwright "Build and tool caches" caution "Playwright browsers"                    "remove them (npx playwright install brings them back)"
add electron   "Build and tool caches" safe    "Electron and electron-builder downloads" "remove both download caches"
